            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A robotic surgical system (10) for use with a localizer (44) comprises a robotic manipulator (14) including a first mounting interface (76, 276), a coupler (70, 170, 270) including a first coupling interface (80), a second coupling interface (82), and a tracker (54A) to be detected by the localizer (44), wherein the first coupling interface (80) is connectable to the first mounting interface (76, 276), and a tool (26) including a second mounting interface (78, 278) selectively connectable to either the second coupling interface (82) or the first mounting interface (76, 276).</p>
            </abstract>
